{%- comment -%}
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
PROMISE FOOTER UTILITY
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Country/language selectors with the payment badges beneath them. Rendered twice — once beside the
monogram for mobile, once in the aside for desktop — because the two positions sit in different
flex parents and cannot be reached by ordering alone. Each render passes a distinct `id_prefix` so
the two disclosure widgets do not share element ids, matching how the header renders this snippet
three times over.

********************************************
Supported variables
********************************************

* variant: "mobile" or "desktop" — drives both the visibility class and the id prefix (required)
* show_country_selector / show_locale_selector: booleans, already resolved by the section
* show_country_name / show_country_flag: passed through to the country selector
* show_payment_icons: boolean
* payment_types: comma-separated payment type handles, in display order
* amex_icon: optional image overriding the stock American Express badge
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign has_selectors = false
  if show_country_selector or show_locale_selector
    assign has_selectors = true
  endif

  assign has_icons = false
  if show_payment_icons and payment_types != blank
    assign has_icons = true
  endif
-%}

{%- if has_selectors or has_icons -%}
  <div class="promise-footer__utility promise-footer__utility--{{ variant }}">
    {%- if has_selectors -%}
      <div class="promise-footer__localization localization-selectors">
        {%- if show_country_selector -%}
          {%- render 'localization-selector',
            type: 'country',
            placement: 'top-start',
            id_prefix: variant,
            show_country_name: show_country_name,
            show_country_flag: show_country_flag
          -%}
        {%- endif -%}

        {%- if show_locale_selector -%}
          {%- render 'localization-selector', type: 'locale', placement: 'top-start', id_prefix: variant -%}
        {%- endif -%}
      </div>
    {%- endif -%}

    {%- if has_icons -%}
      {%- render 'promise-payment-icons', types: payment_types, amex_icon: amex_icon -%}
    {%- endif -%}
  </div>
{%- endif -%}
